<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-20602] Fix cache scan command page size to meet the limit argument </title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-20602</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Cache scan command ignores the limit argument and preloads default page size entries count. This causes excessive heap usage and possible OOM if cache entries are large. &lt;/p&gt;</description>
